      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『旺紫丁总是输。每次都在重复这个过程』——\n她……难道是想战胜那位黄金巨匠吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "053748638d91c628d979044d6638daaa8ee17679a51d72924332c1f26293eee4",
