    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46d5aff7caffc89c969849ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与柔和态度截然相反的坚韧耐心。这份光芒越是萦绕于心，\n就越让人忍不住去想——看似完美的她，到底还缺少什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ba641184ccb8aab3712b676cd39a524a88f79233424a39c7e47c030a680c7b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
