      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对对，只要死守内道说不定也能赢我……才怪啦！\n怎么可能啊！训练员你也打算上场参赛吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb050a14bba7c299a94490d68b4ab6de26862cd4d7a9fe54aff1258ee5379a23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
