    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b20dccb5ec7e19443334b8de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——那是发生在百花初绽、一个风和日丽的春日里的事。\n当我前往赛道时，发现训练员们正注视着某个角落。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ebab49ef673339becf9dd6bbd6f39590a10cd1110ab3d2fbc54b3165fe5e93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
