    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ce96f757fe01eb9a81962d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为在意旺紫丁的事情，我开始关注她与黄金巨匠的\n单挑比赛，这之后过了一段时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f934ee1dae159f79568c14428214777997e9a2f037acf65713213f87123a6c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b26ace3bd0fb48ce44e8a28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（要想让她得到黄金巨匠的认可——）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d3e3e9af185f2ab1d433a94c784a3d850d73da964905816a51ab5da76b218b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86ae8b91bfc56b8c5a808f14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在我手边有一本写满了笔记的备忘录。被不断挑战的她\n所感染……不知不觉间，我开始一边思考一边观看比赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6578a5440d4ccabd3d6e57a67b9aaa5355af5bd34c80562e34b216da91c627d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
