    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e654e547f9535587a4b6f69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以前，我在电视上看到某位赛马娘的奔跑……在赛事这种、\n可以说是“仅仅只是奔跑”的娱乐活动之中——",
      "source_fingerprint": "374b83c40dd4e3a5d742d0bbaedd99f5d859df0f0ed2c3da0caa78e28ae1511e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24480318143d0874116e5c69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旺紫丁",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bd13b5e1395ea87340cd1c102f7f659c57ca9664b7ec0b998ebc201a2149beb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1130/storytimeline_041130002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d3032214b3d00b298e1cc3f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——独自一人绚烂华丽、堂堂正正。她每踏出一步……\n都宛如百花缭乱、争奇斗艳一般。我的心也随之雀跃。",
