    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cb1a741e1c875cb75715f1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……从那之后，我不断磨炼自己……终于走到了\n教官对我说随时都可以出道的这一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2862884ed410af39486ed66638730c7271954b8e1c91fd6690bfd67a09f0db80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
