    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b3aeaced248a7f5fe8aac8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是……仅仅只是出道的话，是无法成为令人憧憬的焦点的。\n我所追求的，是那抹金色的光辉……仅凭优秀，是无法触及的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e538b6edd6dfcb4cbdc79a7c98167ec1fea6419d67f906d3260772640b7f82c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
