      "uid": "zhcn:fa0747243188d5d25b339ecd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯。我想在得到黄金巨匠同学的认可后，再出道。\n于是我去向她搭话……她便向我提议，来场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb1f0e1fa96d5e1c5d842b0e16c092fc8afb8e1908d6cbb0328efedb53a273c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
