    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dec14450445857127fd3b432",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "甚至有人评价为旁若无人的黄金巨匠，却定期接受挑战。\n光从这一点，就能看出她对旺紫丁的评价之高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cd6f7662f119cc7ff9f6b81cc031276934f2be5454ee232d89131f26c470992",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
